					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1654327#post-2479031</guid>
				<title>Tale and that</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-1654327/at-the-library#post-2479031</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 25 Mar 2016 12:17:12 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>Wils</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>2096532</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>This is a sort of prequel to <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2982">SCP-2982</a> and the <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/golan">Golan</a> tale - set before the Foundation got involved.</p> <p>It's the first in a series of snippets of interactions between Harold Maine, a bad guy who has a phone that does bad things, and his victims, who have to do what he says else risk being turned into God knows what. Eh I'm explaining this as if you care.</p> <p>Hope you enjoy. I've tried to keep it short and sweet. If you don't like it, please send £5 to my PayPal account.</p> <p>Depending how it goes, I'd like to add other mini-tales about all the other people he's screwing around with, what he's done to them, how they react etc etc. We'll see.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
